<div class="col-md-6 mb-4 mb-md-0">
<h2 class="mb-2 text-stars-bottom-offset">Choose Your Path</h2>
</div>

<div class="col-md-6">
<p class="mb-0">Whether you&#39;re earning a degree, preparing to transfer to a university, gaining workforce skills, or taking your first college course while in high school, Gadsden State offers flexible pathways to help you achieve your goals. No matter where you&#39;re starting, we&#39;re here to help you take the next step with affordable, accessible education and training.</p>
</div>
