			<div class="bg-white pt-md-5 pb-4">
				<div class="container-lg pt-3">
					<hr>
					<p class="h4 mb-3 text-red">About Gadsden State</p>
					<div class="row mb-4 align-items-center">
						<div class="col-6 col-sm-3 col-lg-2 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
							<img src="/img/gadsden-state-logo.webp" alt="Gadsden State Community College" loading="lazy">
						</div>
						<div class="col-12 col-sm-9 col-lg-6 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
							
							<p class="mb-0">Gadsden State is a public, open door, comprehensive community college that is comprised of five campuses or educational centers in Calhoun, Cherokee and Etowah counties. Gadsden State has a rich and illustrious history within the communities it serves.</p> 
						</div>
						<div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
							<div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-3">
								<img src="/img/logo-sacscoc.webp" alt="Southern Association of Colleges and Schools" width="80"  loading="lazy">
								<img src="/img/logo-acc.webp" alt="Alabama Community College System" width="80"  loading="lazy">
								<img src="/img/logo-at.svg" alt="Alabama Transfers" width="80"  loading="lazy">
							</div>
